<title>AUSTRALIA: Australia's SFE wheat futures mixed.</title>
<headline>Australia's SFE wheat futures mixed.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sydney Futures Exchange (SFE) wheat futures were mixed in light trading on Monday.</p>
<p>In the only two months traded, January 1998 fell A$1.50 to A$165.50 a tonne on a volume of 17 lots while the July 1998 contract rose A$1.50 to A$174.00 on a volume of two lots.</p>
<p>Settlement prices for the other contracts were mostly unchanged.</p>
